This nested loop checks whether an array has any duplicates. What is the best efficiency improvement?

```
var hasDuplicates = false
for i in 0..<nums.count {
    for j in 0..<nums.count {
        if i != j && nums[i] == nums[j] {
            hasDuplicates = true
        }
    }
}
```

